= Reentry Into the Bauer Cabinet

<img src="img/portraits/BauerGustav.jpeg" style="float:left; margin-right:1em; margin-bottom:0.5em; width:220px; object-fit:cover; object-position:top; border:2px solid #000000ff;"> <br> Ever since the acceptance of the humiliating treaty of Versailles in June, our formal participation in the government has been hindered by the SPD and Z’s bitterness over our desire to “evade responsibility”, and by our fundamental criticism of the plans by the SPD and Economic Minister WIssel's plans for a <span style="color: var(--kpd-colour);">socialization</span> of the economy, with earlier negotiations in July being rejected by both our party and the cabinet. But now, we have been approached again and we must decide whether or not to enter government.


